### **SECTION 2: TWO CERTIFICATION LEVELS**

#### **Level One: Cyber Essentials (Self-Assessment)**

**Full Text:**

```
Cyber Essentials is an independently verified self-assessment

Cyber Essentials works in the format of a self-assessment questionnaire. 
Organisations of all sizes answer the same set of questions that address 
the scope of the assessment, their employees, devices, and work location.

They will also answer questions that address the five core controls, which 
include user access control, secure configuration, security update 
